"Migrate from using the original primitives (Estimator and Sampler) to using "
"the updated V2 primitives (Estimator V2 and Sampler V2)"
msgstr ""
"Migre de l'utilisation des primitives originales (Estimator et Sampler) vers"
" l'utilisation des primitives V2 mises à jour (Estimator V2 et Sampler V2)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to the Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives"
msgstr "Migrer vers les primitives V2"

