msgstr "Changements majeurs {#major-changes}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import {#import}"
msgstr "Import {#import}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, you must explicity import the V2 primitives. "
"Specifying `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` is not required, but makes "
"it easier to transition code to V2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour la compatibilité rétroactive, tu dois importer explicitement les "
"primitives V2. Spécifier `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` n'est pas "
"obligatoire, mais rend plus facile la transition du code vers V2.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"After the V1 primitives are no longer supported, `import <primitive>` will import the V2 version of the specified primitive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"Une fois que les primitives V1 ne seront plus supportées, `import <primitive>` importera la version V2 de la primitive spécifiée.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

