"options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore sessions and advanced options to optimize circuit performance on "
"QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Explore les sessions et les options avancées pour optimiser la performance "
"des circuits sur les QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
